We may now summarize the passage’s before-and-after contrast as $P_{\mathrm{comm},\mathrm{now}} > P_{\mathrm{comm},\mathrm{past}}
\qquad\Longrightarrow\qquad
V_{\mathrm{remote},\mathrm{now}} > V_{\mathrm{remote},\mathrm{past}} .$ Once that inequality is in place, the opening observation follows naturally: $A_{\mathrm{remote},\mathrm{now}} > A_{\mathrm{remote},\mathrm{past}} .$

